From 8a179f8876a79f3a6ef20bfe6f45e82e2ed3fcc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:47:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mix.json: the ground sound thread's land block of 12:46Z (two
 more Maxim stretches)

land.mgClose.moreParts: maxim_burst's first two bursts (0.03-0.66 s and
0.9-1.6 s), with a _moreParts note, so a crowded Soviet section's burst plays
from one of them instead of a copy already sounding. Nothing else in the land
block changes; nothing in the air block changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01L4rhz35oCkUv94Xb2EwCjp
