pson_cock), each null with a note, so no clip cue asks for a missing take; no sound changes. 22 Nov 04:20Z: round nine stamped by Brian (03:40Z): real B-17s replace the studio library's. Riding a B-17 plays one of two recordings from inside one (air.closeView.bed.interior B-17, a list now, one per ridden bomber), and a B-17 formation's engines are three B-17s filmed flying over (air.loops B-17); levels unchanged (-20.0 LUFS). Land block updated 22 Nov 05:40Z by the ground sound thread: land.tankMg (a tank's machine guns by army, and the Sherman's roof .50 on gunner_burst), and land.mgClose.parts gains gunner_burst and maxim_burst (_parts says why); no take from outside the approved pack. 22 Nov (patch 0021, the Bremen r2d film): the close view's guns stand out of the ridden engine: air.closeView.masterDb 7.5 -> 9.5 and bed.gainDb 6 -> 1 (the notes say why); a gunner's twin mount is heard as one take (gunsByCalibre._wing); notes corrected where the code differs (masterDbByCameraDistance, closeView._notBuilt). Land block updated 22 Nov 12:46Z by the ground sound thread: land.mgClose.moreParts (maxim_burst's first two bursts, so a crowded Soviet section's burst plays from one of them instead of a copy already sounding; _moreParts says why); nothing else changes.",
